    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22549" root="شغر" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَغُورٌ</span></b>  A <i>tall</i> she-camel, <i>that raises her legs</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشْغَرُ بِقَوَائِمِهَا</span>) <i>when she is taken to be ridden</i>
(K, TA) or <i>to be milked.</i> (TA.)

